[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6000.95, "timestamp": "01:40:00", "text": "比如在未来，但不是任何时候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6006.469, "timestamp": "01:40:06", "text": "你好吗？你的东西怎么样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6009.51, "timestamp": "01:40:09", "text": "去？一切进展顺利。我速度很快"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6011.59, "timestamp": "01:40:11", "text": "目前正在进行合作项目。我邀请"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6014.07, "timestamp": "01:40:14", "text": "不小心邀请了太多人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6017.349, "timestamp": "01:40:17", "text": "这一点，我就想，是的，我必须……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6021.429, "timestamp": "01:40:21", "text": "呃，我邀请了人，所以我得……呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6028.55, "timestamp": "01:40:28", "text": "所以你与人互动是件好事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6031.51, "timestamp": "01:40:31", "text": "很多人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6033.15, "timestamp": "01:40:33", "text": "以便"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6037.99, "timestamp": "01:40:37", "text": "是啊，真的很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6040.71, "timestamp": "01:40:40", "text": "嗯，主要是为了认识人，更主要是为了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6042.469, "timestamp": "01:40:42", "text": "与我曾经拥有的人重新建立联系"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6045.349, "timestamp": "01:40:45", "text": "之前互动过，但后来无法互动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6048.469, "timestamp": "01:40:48", "text": "等了很久，现在我终于可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6050.469, "timestamp": "01:40:50", "text": "与他们互动，那真是一件……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6057.83, "timestamp": "01:40:57", "text": "是的，我刚刚意识到这一点"}]